// Atmosphere — the autonomous hum of a dying computer. Pure mood, no
// consequences; the threat in this house is reactive, not ambient.

GENERATOR ScreensaverHum
  tier: ambient
  every 4m
  yield bark from The screensaver changes. Pipes now. | A fan spins up somewhere in the walls. | An LED that was green is amber. Nobody saw it change. | The encyclopaedias smell like a basement in 1994.

GENERATOR DialUp
  tier: ambient
  every 7m
  yield bark from From the Registry: a dial tone, then the shriek. | A modem handshakes with something very patient. | The far end of the line says a name you can't quite hear.

GENERATOR SystemTray
  tier: ambient
  every 9m
  yield bark from 3 programs have viewed your profile. | You have (1) unread message from a program you have not met. | Memory usage: 97%. Consider closing some memories. | Your protection has expired.
